      <details><summary>Is physiotherapy covered by extended health benefits in Canada?</summary><p>Many extended health plans include physiotherapy benefits. A visit is claimable when it is provided by a registered physiotherapist working within their scope of practice and billed under the physiotherapy category. Coverage amounts and rules depend on your own plan, so confirm with your insurer and the clinic before you book.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Which treatments on WellFinder bill under physiotherapy?</summary><p>Treatments that bill under physiotherapy include Clinical Pilates, Golf Swing Assessment, Red Light Therapy, Cryotherapy, Pelvic Floor Physiotherapy, Bike Fitting, Running Gait Analysis, Shockwave Therapy, Performing Arts Physiotherapy and Vestibular Rehabilitation. Each treatment page shows how clinics bill the visit, so you can match it to your plan.</p></details>
